/* modsncpy MODULE (primary) */
/* charset=ISO8859-1 */
/* lang=C++20 */

/* UNIX® kernel support subroutines */
/* version %I% last-modified %G% */


/* revision history:

	= 1998-03-26, David A­D­ Morano
	This was first written to give a little bit to UNIX® what
	we have in our own circuit-pack OSes!

